    "details": "<p><strong>Overview</strong></p>\n<p>Zeckathon is a 3-day inter-collegiate fintech hackathon, from 27 October to 29 October 2026, conducted by the Trading and Investment Club, IIT Patna.</p>\n<p>Teams pick one of four problem statements and solve it using real, publicly available Indian market data.:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Equity Research</li>\n<li>Risk &amp; Fraud Analytics</li>\n<li>Financial Forecasting</li>\n<li>AI-Powered Financial Advisory&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Eligibility:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Teams of 1 to 4 members.</li>\n<li>All members must belong to the SAME college; cross-college teams are not allowed.</li>\n<li>Please submit one response per team, filled in by the team leader</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Join the official Zeckathon WhatsApp group for updates:<strong> <a href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/FoYaVhQJ8jqCRCXGaIWD4v\">https://chat.whatsapp.com/FoYaVhQJ8jqCRCXGaIWD4v</a></strong></p>",
